                "retweet_count": 136,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Trump could follow court orders, he just doesn't care to do that or feed the 42 million Americans who rely on SNAP.\n\nHe's never cared about you, your healthcare, or your ability to put food on the table.\n\nHe's a mob boss through and through.",
