                "retweet_count": 141,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For the last 41 days, Speaker Johnson has shown that he doesn't care about you or your healthcare.\n\nIt's no surprise that even with a so called \"deal\" in the Senate, he wouldn't care.\n\nWhen someone shows you who they are, believe them.",
