                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Shame on Trump and Republicans who care more about lowering taxes for billionaires than lowering costs for the average American.\n\u00a0\nI made a promise to fight as hard as I can to lower healthcare costs and that\u2019s what I\u2019m going to continue to do. https://t.co/JVL3N7IBQy",
